WEBVTT

00:00.160 --> 00:06.500
As for the rest, Zhen will inquire no further. Regarding this uprising, Zhen has only one final question.

00:06.920 --> 00:07.800
Imperial Father, please ask.

00:08.320 --> 00:14.500
Deploying the capital garrison: was it your explicit command, or did Chu Huan act on his own initiative? Answer truthfully!
